  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "敌人只在玩家行动后移动，因此闪避、招架和反击都能逐步规划，也可熟练后加快节奏并用四方向单手操作。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Enemies move only after you do. Every dodge, parry, and counterattack is yours to plan — no twitch reflexes required, but nothing stopping you from playing fast once you've mastered the rhythm. One-handed friendly: four directions is all you need.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3720420/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "十四种武器各有升级路线，再从两百多张能力卡中拼出闪电、炮塔、无敌或手里剑等流派。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Wield 14 weapons — from greatswords to laser cannons to your own golden skull — each with its own upgrade path. Draw from 200+ ability cards to piece together lightning builds, turret builds, invincibility builds, shuriken builds, and more.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3720420/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "环境、敌人、NPC与宝箱都能被打碎、移动或利用，程序生成关卡还会持续提供隐藏房间和事件。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Everything you see can be broken. Environments, enemies, NPCs, treasure chests — smash it, move it, use it. Procedurally generated levels keep every run stocked with new hidden rooms and events.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3720420/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
  "opinions": [
